# Seasons, weeks and quests

Seasons, weeks and daily quests roll over at fixed UTC instants: days at 00:00 UTC and weeks on Monday
at 00:00 UTC, the same moment in every region, because tournaments are global.
function questDay(date = new Date()) {
  return date.toISOString().slice(0, 10);
}

module.exports = { questDay };
